    "comparison": "AA on/off retain independent histories/exposure and baked-light delivery slots. Each advances once per identical simulation frame, with alternating render order. Runtime light/lamp deliveries are forwarded before the pair; mid-pair arrivals wait. No toggling or repeated snapshot render enters measurements.",
